    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, there is no \"self-discovery\" left to do. the emptiness is all that's left. it's like i'm just a hollow shell of a person. everyone is just interacting with a memory, not me. it's exhausting trying to pretend I'm still here when the real me is already dead.",
